  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conservation of the Late 19th-Century Juan Manuel Blanes Municipal Museum of the Arts Building in Montevideo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Housed in a 19th-century villa, the Blanes Municipal Museum displays Uruguayan art from the nation&apos;s founding in the 19th century to the present day. This project includes the conservation of the building&apos;s masonry facades.</narrative>
